msgid "Value"
msgstr "Hodnota"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:68
msgid "Disable Repeat"
msgstr "Zakázať opakovanie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:69
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:72
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:75
msgid "Switch"
msgstr "Prepínač"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:70
msgid ""
"When animating properties with keyframes, whether to repeat the animation "
"after it reaches the last key frame. Default is **on**."
msgstr ""
"Pri animácii vlastností kľúčovými snímkami, či sa má animácia opakovať po "
"dosiahnutí poslednej kľúčovej snímky. Predvolene je **zapnuté**."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:71
msgid "Disable Mirror"
msgstr "Zakázať zrkadlenie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:73
msgid ""
"When animating properties with keyframes and :guilabel:`Disable repeat` is "
"**off**, whether the animation alternates between reverses and forwards for "
"each repetition. Default is **on**."
msgstr ""
"Pri animácii vlastností kľúčovými snímkami a keď je :guilabel:`Zakázať "
"opakovanie` **vypnuté**, či animácia striedavo prechádza dopredu a dozadu "
"pri každom opakovaní. Predvolene je **zapnuté**."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:74
msgid "Invert Scale"
msgstr "Prevrátiť mierku"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:76
msgid ""
"Whether to invert the :guilabel:`Scale X` and :guilabel:`Scale Y` values. "
"This is helpful to make animation interpolation sane because otherwise the "
"scale values do not animate linearly. Default is **on**."
msgstr ""
"Či prevrátiť hodnoty :guilabel:`Mierka X` a :guilabel:`Mierka Y`. To je "
"užitočné na dosiahnutie rozumnej interpolácie animácie, pretože inak sa "
"hodnoty mierky neanimujú lineárne. Predvolene je **zapnuté**."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:77
msgid "Rotate X / Y / Z"
msgstr "Otočiť X / Y / Z"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:78
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:81
#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:84
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Celé číslo"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:79
msgid ""
"Set the amount of rotation along the respective axes in degrees of rotation."
msgstr "Nastavte množstvo otočenia pozdĺž príslušných osí v stupňoch otočenia."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:80
msgid "Offset X / Y"
msgstr "Posun X / Y"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:82
msgid "Horizontal (X) and vertical (Y) offset"
msgstr "Vodorovný (X) a zvislý (Y) posun"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:83
msgid "Scale X / Y"
msgstr "Mierka X / Y"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:85
msgid "Scale factor applied to the X and Y axis"
msgstr "Faktor mierky aplikovaný na osi X a Y"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:86
msgid "Background Color"
msgstr "Farba pozadia"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:87
msgid "Picker"
msgstr "Výberník"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:88
msgid ""
"Define the background color to be used when rotating reveals the background. "
"Default is **Alpha**."
msgstr ""
"Definujte farbu pozadia, ktorá sa má použiť, keď otáčanie odhalí pozadie. "
"Predvolene je **Alfa**."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/transform_distort_perspective/rotate_3_way.rst:92
msgid ""
"The axes for rotation are different than for moving a clip. The latter uses "
"the monitor plane: X = width or horizontal axis, Y = height or vertical "
"axis. For rotation the plane is tilted by 90 degrees \"into the monitor\" "
"and rotated 90 degrees clockwise around the vertical axis. This results in "
"the X axis coming out of/going into the monitor, the Y axis being along the "
"width of the monitor and the Z axis being along the height of the monitor. "
"See image below."
msgstr ""
"Osi otáčania sa líšia od osí pre presúvanie klipu. Druhé menované používa "
"rovinu monitora: X = šírka alebo vodorovná os, Y = výška alebo zvislá os. "
"Pre otáčanie je rovina naklonená o 90 stupňov „do monitora\" a otočená o 90 "
"stupňov v smere hodinových ručičiek okolo zvislej osi. Výsledkom je os X "
"vychádzajúca z/vchádzajúca do monitora, os Y pozdĺž šírky monitora a os Z "
"pozdĺž výšky monitora. Pozrite obrázok nižšie."

